<title>TAIWAN: Formosa Taffeta Jan-Aug profit up 30 pct.</title>
<headline>Formosa Taffeta Jan-Aug profit up 30 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Formosa Taffeta said on Wednesday its profits between January and August rose 30 percent to T$1.160 billion compared with the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>The firm is one of Taiwan's leading makers of umbrella frames and plastic bags.</p>
<p>In the month of August, its profit was T$106.97 million, down 24.5 percent from August 1995, a company statement said.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
